            Move (archive_read_support_format_tar (pArchive)) to iResult
            Delegate Get OpenMemoryNextHeader pArchive (&ucZip) to iResult
            Send AssertIAreEqual ARCHIVE_FATAL iResult "tar reader on zip data"
            Move (archive_read_free (pArchive)) to iResult

            Move (archive_read_new ()) to pArchive
            Move (archive_read_support_format_7zip (pArchive)) to iResult
            Delegate Get OpenMemoryNextHeader pArchive (&ucZip) to iResult
            Send AssertIAreEqual ARCHIVE_FATAL iResult "7zip reader on zip data"
